  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_2",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s2"
      },
      "text": "The team identifies this malware as TRISIS because it targets Schneider Elec­ tric’s Triconex safety instrumented system (SIS) enabling the replacement of logic in final control elements.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_3",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "Importantly, the malware leverages no inherent vulnerability in Schneider Electric products.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_26",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 11,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p11_s3"
      },
      "text": "The script aims to change the underlying logic on a target SIS – in this case, a Schneider Electric Triconex device.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_27",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 11,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p11_s4"
      },
      "text": "Subsequent code analysis indicated the script is designed to target Triconex 3008 processor modules specifically.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_33",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 12,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p12_s3"
      },
      "text": "Upon running the TRISIS executable, disguised as Triconex software for analyzing SIS logs, the mali­ cious software utilizes the embedded binary files to identify the appropriate location in memory on the controller for logic replacement and uploads the ‘ini­ tializing code’ (4-byte sequence)",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_50",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 18,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p18_s1"
      },
      "text": "TRISIS is the fifth ever publicly known ICS-tailored malware following STUXNET, HAVEX, BLACKENERGY2, and CRASHOVERRIDE.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_55",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 19,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p19_s1"
      },
      "text": "Vendors targeted in specific malware implementations such as Schneider Electric with TRISIS are victims.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_56",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Dragos_TRISIS-01(12-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 19,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p19_s2"
      },
      "text": "The malware was not designed because Triconex was a good choice for this attack; the malware would have been designed because the intended victim was using Triconex.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_61",
